Z||000000||DrRodey||04-04-2001||02:19 PM||||Well It's now officially up to Three "Babies" in my family.  I just got back from a Thrilling trip to MD to pick up an 84 T-Top, which on the way home sent me on a wonderful little off-road excursion.  <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Ditch01.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Ditch02.jpg"> <P>Thankfully It wasn't all that bad, just droped the Jeep into 4x4 pulled it back to the Hwy and keept going.  with no further problems. <BR> <BR>Here's a few pix from that evening at the hotel.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trail01.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trail02.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trail03.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trail04.jpg"> <P>Hope ya'll enjoy the pix as much as I enjoy the car.<BR> <P>------------------<BR>Hi... My names Dan, and i'm addicted to Fieros.<BR>'88 Formula CONVERTIBLE<BR>'85 Coupe<BR>'84 coupe T-Top<BR>AOL IM = drrodey<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_2.JPG">   <BR> <A HREF="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/HomePlace.html" TARGET=_blank>freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/HomePlace.html</A>||||reg||1
